      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Welcome to the first pre-alpha test of Critter Hunt!


        How
        to play:

        AWSD - movement

        Shift - sprint

        E - interact

        Left
        Click - swing left hand weapon

        Right Click - use right hand item

        Scroll
        Wheel - change between right hand items


        Esc - Pause Menu

        I
        - Inventory

        J - CritterDex

        M - Map (unfinished)


        Speak
        with your Auntie to get more info!

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
